{"5026390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cobble Climber", "steam_appid": 5026390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5035930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/ef3409d76f1066f6096de68c984e197a.avif?t=1788080203\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Cobble climber is a difficult climbing game where you control each hand. Each hold has a countdown and taking too long will increase the risk of drowning in the rising water level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend, you'll find lost possessions and notes about the world you're trapped in</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/2f956d04022eae89eb8e10fd9ea30f4c.poster.avif?t=1788080203\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/2f956d04022eae89eb8e10fd9ea30f4c.webm?t=1788080203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/2f956d04022eae89eb8e10fd9ea30f4c.mp4?t=1788080203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fall</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/7c56611cc8037e5038ccadd23d8817bf.poster.avif?t=1788080203\" width=798 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5026390/extras/7c56611cc8037e5038ccadd23d8817bf.webm?t=1788080203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so